// ============================================================================
// Detection: Lateral Movement via Cross-Namespace Token Use
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1550.001 - Application Access Token
// Source: AKSAudit
// ============================================================================

// HOW THIS DETECTION WORKS
// -------------------------
// A ServiceAccount identity is namespaced: its username has the shape
// `system:serviceaccount:<namespace>:<name>`. Normally a workload's SA only ever
// touches resources in its OWN namespace. When an SA from namespace A starts
// acting on resources in namespace B, that's a strong lateral-movement signal —
// the attacker stole a token in A and is reusing it to reach into B
// (T1550.001 Use Alternate Authentication Material: Application Access Token).
//
// The core trick: derive the SOURCE namespace from the SA username, compare it to
// the TARGET namespace on the object being accessed, and alert when they differ.
//
// TABLE: AKSAudit — the full audit log (we need reads: get/list, not just writes).

AKSAudit
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1h)                          // recent window first
| where Verb in ("get", "list", "create", "exec")        // read/create/exec — the actions worth tracking
| extend Username = tostring(User.username)               // pull the caller identity out as a string
// extract() runs a regex and returns capture group 1: the namespace embedded in a
// ServiceAccount username. For a non-SA (a human/AAD user) there's no match -> "".
| extend SourceNamespace = extract("system:serviceaccount:([^:]+):", 1, Username)
| extend TargetNamespace = tostring(ObjectRef.namespace)  // the namespace of the object being touched
| where isnotempty(SourceNamespace)                       // keep only ServiceAccount callers
| where isnotempty(TargetNamespace)                       // keep only namespaced target objects
| where SourceNamespace != TargetNamespace                // THE FINDING: cross-namespace access
| project TimeGenerated, Username, SourceNamespace, TargetNamespace, Verb, Resource = tostring(ObjectRef.resource)  // who went where, doing what
| extend MitreTechnique = "T1550.001"    // tag with the ATT&CK sub-technique
